   "text": "Each constituent isomorphism in the construction of [def-sfb-comap-mapmod-square] (associators,\ncompatibility of restriction of scalars with composition and with equal morphisms, compatibility\nof $\\mathrm{mapMod}(F)$ with restriction of scalars) has identity underlying morphisms, and so\ndoes their composite.",
